xe.","Huh. No trees up here?"]},Stablehand:{any:["Smells like horses. Oh wait, that's me.","Who's minding the horses?!"]},Militia:{any:["Militia, reporting! …To who? Where?","Ten days of training. I'm ready. Ish."]},Apprentice:{any:["My master's gonna KILL me.","I didn't finish the lesson. Is that important?"]},Squire:{any:["Sir? SIR? Where's my knight?","Do I polish things here? I'm good at polishing."]},Scout:{any:["I counted twelve exits on the way down. Kidding. There were none.","Recon says: we're very high up."]},Acolyte:{any:["Is this a sign from the gods? Are YOU the sign?","I prayed for change. Not this much change."]},Footman:{any:["Shield up. Shield - where's my shield.","Point me at the line and I'll hold it."]},Trapper:{any:["Didn't set a trap for THIS.","Something's hunting something here. I can feel it."]},Brawler:{any:["Who wants a punch? Anybody? You?","Finally. Something worth fighting."]},Herbalist:{any:["My poor herbs. Wilted, all of them.","You need a tea. You look stressed. I'm stressed."]},Slinger:{any:["Got a pocket full of rocks and no idea where I am.","Give me a target. Any target."]},Initiate:{any:["Is this the test? Am I passing?","The elders never mentioned THIS."]},Guardsman:{any:["Halt! …Halt who? Where am I?","My post! Somebody's gonna rob the gate!"]},Warrior:{any:["Ha! A fight's coming, I can smell it.","Whoever brought me - point. I'll swing."]},Rogue:{any:["Didn't steal anything. Swear. Okay, one thing.","Nice place. Lots of pockets."]},Archer:{any:["Get me a bow and stand back.","Quiet. I'm counting the wind."]},Mage:{any:["Fascinating. Terrible, but fascinating.","Somebody botched that spell. Badly. Was it you?"]},Cleric:{any:["The light brought me here? …Fine. I'll heal who I have to.","Bless you. You look like you need it."]},Lancer:{any:["Where's my horse? I'm useless without the horse.","Long spear, short temper. Hi."]},Ranger:{any:["Wild country up here. I like it.","Tracks everywhere. Nobody's, everybody's."]},Monk:{any:[